# decode from utf16le/be or utf32le/be to utf8
Server init.
>> utf16 := Blob ନୂତନ: 8, bytes: (
	ସାରଣୀ ନୂତନ ; Hx x41 ; Hx x00 ; Hx x3D ; Hx xD8
	         ; Hx x0A ; Hx xDE ; Hx x42 ; Hx x00
).

ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: ( utf16 ଡିକୋଡ୍: ['utf16le'] ), ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.

utf16 ମୁକ୍ତ.
>> utf32 := Blob ନୂତନ: 13, bytes: (
	ସାରଣୀ ନୂତନ ; Hx x00 ; Hx x00 ; Hx x00 ; Hx x41
	         ; Hx x00 ; Hx x01 ; Hx xF6 ; Hx x0A
	         ; Hx x00 ; Hx x00 ; Hx x00 ; Hx x42
	         ; Hx x00
).

ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: ( utf32 ଡିକୋଡ୍: ['utf32be'] ), ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
utf32 ମୁକ୍ତ.